OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse a priority for new
OL,4,Apolice chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new chief constable says tackling
OL,7,Fissues raised in a critical report,
OL,8,Fincluding how domestic abuse cases are
OL,9,Fhandled, is his priority.
OL,11,FA police effectiveness, efficiency and
OL,12,Flegitimacy (PEEL) report found Suffolk
OL,13,FConstabulary had not made progress in
OL,14,Fhow it managed levels of risk in
OL,15,Fdomestic abuse cases.
OL,17,FMark Webster has come out of retirement
OL,18,Fto temporarily lead the force until a
OL,19,Fpermanent appointment is made next
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
