OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse a priority for new
OL,4,Apolice chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the PEEL report would provide a
OL,7,F"baseline" for priorities going forward
OL,8,Fand he would look to "make the good
OL,9,Fstuff even better and actually deal
OL,10,Fwith the issues that are unresolved in
OL,11,Fthere."
